              <h3 style="color:#1a3a5c;margin:20px 0 8px;">
                Last-Minute Checklist
              </h3>
              <ul style="margin:8px 0;padding-left:20px;">
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Program your radio to
                  <strong>147.42&nbsp;MHz simplex</strong>
                  tonight
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Check your antenna mount and cable connections
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Charge your handheld and spare batteries
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Bring a map or have your navigation app
                  ready for plotting bearings
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Pack walking shoes, water, snacks, and a
                  jacket for the final on-foot leg
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Top off the fuel tank tonight
                </li>
              </ul>

              <p style="background-color:#fce4e4;border-left:4px solid
                        #c62828;padding:12px 16px;margin:20px 0;
                        font-size:14px;">
                <strong>Safety reminder:</strong> Stay on public
                roads and legal pedestrian routes only, and follow
                hunt-day boundary instructions.
